# Prompt Engineering Notes

A collection of prompts, techniques, and examples for generating
clear and structured B.Tech study notes using AI tools.

## Purpose

This repository contains reusable prompts that can be used with
AI tools such as ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and other AI assistants.

## Main Prompt

The main notes-generation prompt is available here:

- `notes-generation-prompt.md`

## Goals

- Generate structured study notes
- Make difficult topics easier to understand
- Create exam-oriented revision material
- Generate practice questions
- Improve the quality of AI-generated educational content

